If you tell him you got the muffins at the Brownloe bakery, he'll go there. As soon as he leaves, this ward comes out and will talk to you. This dovetails into the [[Hogcaller's Inn]] Quest.

== Faction Gains - Personal Experience ==

53 Halfling Druid: 660 muffins took me from Apprehensive to Kindly. 8/19/2022

22 Iksar Monk: ~1200 muffins took me from KOS to Apprehensive, ~900 to dubious 5/8/2023 -- Pandos is red at this level and hits for about 50. It is possible to run to the corner inside the door and FD then sneak to hand in at KOS/Threatening.

